rature, humidity etc • Classification is used to predict which class a data point is part of ( discreet value ) • Example – o Classifying mail as spam or not spam o Identifying a fruit based on size, color, length , diameter etc o Identifying if a tumor is begin or malignant	\N	f	2026-09-01 21:23:12.626+03	2026-09-01 21:23:11.774408+03	2026-09-01 21:23:11.774408+03
