ection . task of finding the best hypot hesis consists of : • model selection defines the hypothesis space and then • optimization finds the best hypothesis within that space.	\N	f	2026-09-01 21:23:12.626+03	2026-09-01 21:23:11.774408+03	2026-09-01 21:23:11.774408+03
