lude + C).\\"}],\\"finalCheck\\":\\"Confirm you chose u and dv intentionally, showed du and v, applied ∫ u dv = u v − ∫ v du correctly, and simplified to e^x(x − 1) + C.\\",\\"sourceGrounding\\":[{\\"label\\":\\"Standard calculus textbook\\",\\"reference\\":\\"Integration by parts formula and basic integrals (∫ e^x = e^x)\\"}]}", "startedAtMs": 59231, "completedAtMs": 59231, "sourceAnchors": [], "decisionFactors": ["Prerequisite and goal framing completed — safe to practice applying the procedure.", "Only one move remaining and limited time — choose a focused worked example rather than branching activities.", "Topic profile strongly recommends worked examples for procedural learning of integration by parts.", "Student persona 'confidently_wrong' benefits from guided practice with prediction points to catch overconfident errors."], "artifactProposed": false, "expectedEvidence": "Student states choices for u and dv, computes du and v, assembles the integration-by-parts result, and simplifies the final expression correctly (with at most one minor arithmetic slip).", "firstContentAtMs": 59231, "studentSafeReason": "Student already passed the prerequisite and has a clear, timeboxed goal; a single, guided worked example is the most efficient next step to practice choosing u and dv and performing the steps.", "studentConsentRequired": false}	2026-08-09 18:35:00.905796+03
