or ∫ x e^x dx in one line (including + C).\\",\\"sourceGrounding\\":[{\\"label\\":\\"Standard calculus technique\\",\\"reference\\":\\"Integration by parts formula: ∫ u dv = u v − ∫ v du (basic integral table)\\"}]}", "startedAtMs": 48995, "completedAtMs": 48995, "sourceAnchors": [], "decisionFactors": ["Topic profile practicePattern recommends worked_example next", "Short remaining time — one worked example then a single practice item fits budget", "Student persona repeated_struggle — stepwise worked example reduces confusion and supports immediate practice"], "artifactProposed": false, "expectedEvidence": "Student follows the worked example steps and can answer a short prediction/next-step question about the example (shows correct selection or short answer for 1 prediction point).", "firstContentAtMs": 48995, "studentSafeReason": "Present a single procedural worked example (with small, visible steps) to build procedural fluency while keeping cognitive load low for a student with repeated_struggle.", "studentConsentRequired": false}	2026-08-09 18:35:00.905796+03
