tment (e.g., agrees/disagrees with the statement) and provides a short justification or selection that reveals whether they hold the 'soil-food' misconception.", "firstContentAtMs": 13640, "studentSafeReason": "This move gently uncovers a common, low-risk misconception (plants get food from soil) and asks for a small commitment before correcting it—appropriate for a beginner-friendly revision session.", "studentConsentRequired": false}	2026-08-09 18:35:00.905796+03
