ction."], "artifactProposed": false, "expectedEvidence": "Learner agrees to attempt a short prediction/commitment and, after the activity, can state that plants make glucose from CO2 and H2O using light energy (not by taking food from soil).", "firstContentAtMs": 15031, "studentSafeReason": "This move targets a common, high-impact misconception so the learner can build an accurate model of how plants make their own food.", "studentConsentRequired": false}	2026-08-09 18:35:00.905796+03
