ical exclusion from decision-making. These combined pressures helped push many people toward demanding major change.\\"}", "startedAtMs": 27508, "completedAtMs": 27508, "sourceAnchors": [], "decisionFactors": ["Topic profile recommends 'story' as the second opening move after goal framing.", "Learner persona 'repeated_struggle' benefits from narrative anchoring and reduced abstraction.", "Low prerequisite density and low misconception richness — a focused illustrative story will aid recall.", "Timebox and remaining moves favour a single short, scaffolded example rather than multiple problems."], "artifactProposed": false, "expectedEvidence": "Learner identifies at least one key cause mentioned in the story and applies it (one or two sentences) to a short example or micro-scenario provided.", "firstContentAtMs": 27508, "studentSafeReason": "Story move is appropriate: engages learner by placing causes in a narrative context and provides a concrete example to apply a cause.", "studentConsentRequired": false}	2026-08-09 18:35:00.905796+03
