le 3 (p. 1–10, Slides 2 & 5)"}, {"label": "Locations requiring fall protection", "reference": "Construction Safety, Tunnelling & Ergonomics — Module 3 (p. 1–10, Slide 6)"}, {"label": "PFAS rules and guardrail dimensions", "reference": "Construction Safety, Tunnelling & Ergonomics — Module 3 (p. 1–10, Slides 8 & 9)"}]}	{"expandedLayerIds": []}	\N	ai	teaching.move.layered_explanation.render	v1	v1	{"cached": false, "modelKey": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite", "providerKey": "google-gemini", "fallbackTier": 0}	b6dce847-80e5-41d7-8e72-f35decf99994	\N	2026-09-02 19:18:26.218955+03	2026-09-02 19:18:26.218955+03	0
